WEBVTT

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:17.090
I will marry the emperor

00:00:18.190 --> 00:00:20.160
I will become his wife

00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:25.650
I will be the empress

00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:33.730
Until I hear it from the emperor,

00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:36.190
I won't believe it

00:00:36.190 --> 00:00:39.130
There are words that the emperor cannot say

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:48.280
Project coordinator, editor, typesetter and song translator: Nemie

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:45.080
All the clans are discussing
how can you overthrow the emperor

00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:50.200
He stopped the capital from being moved to Seogyeong

00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:58.380
Translators: Nemie, Kaia, tamaramin

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:55.410
The Yu clan of Jeongju is worried about this,
because the one they mistreated took the throne

00:00:55.410 --> 00:00:57.820
The powerful clans of Songak too...

00:00:58.480 --> 00:01:08.480
Beta Editor: Sana

00:01:00.590 --> 00:01:01.890
Do you see?

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:05.780
This is something the Emperor can't talk to you about.

00:01:06.530 --> 00:01:12.220
These small cozy chambers are enough for you, in which you can wait for him.

00:01:13.290 --> 00:01:16.520
But if a woman who is satisfied with a simple room becomes an empress,

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:19.570
this country will be in trouble

00:01:21.070 --> 00:01:24.420
His Majesty will have to renounce the throne

00:01:24.420 --> 00:01:25.910
Your Highness,

00:01:27.510 --> 00:01:29.500
Are you saying that you can stop this?

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:30.850
One more thing

00:01:31.810 --> 00:01:36.000
An emperor cannot marry a woman with a scar on her body.

00:01:40.820 --> 00:01:43.630
I told you about how we can get along together

00:01:43.630 --> 00:01:46.350
It's up to you whether the situation gets worse or not.

00:01:54.640 --> 00:01:56.900
I am a native of the Hwangbo clan from Hwangju

00:01:57.830 --> 00:02:00.140
Daughter of the late Emperor Taejo

00:02:01.570 --> 00:02:06.260
If not me, then who can protect the emperor?

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:30.540
This girl can't become empress

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:32.170
If I said I would...

00:02:33.650 --> 00:02:34.900
I'll do it

00:02:34.900 --> 00:02:36.400
You must have forgotten

00:02:37.160 --> 00:02:41.150
To avoid marriage with Emperor Taejo,

00:02:42.490 --> 00:02:44.290
she cut her hand

00:02:47.050 --> 00:02:49.110
A woman with a scar on her body...

00:02:50.240 --> 00:02:52.640
cannot become the emperor's wife

00:02:54.860 --> 00:02:57.590
If you insist on getting married, then there are some things you can do

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:01.030
Give up the throne

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:05.110
What would you rather give up?

00:03:05.610 --> 00:03:06.980
From the throne?

00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:09.930
Or from Hae Soo?

00:03:19.280 --> 00:03:21.730
Neither one nor the other

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:25.620
Others may refuse

00:03:26.740 --> 00:03:29.060
and I ascended the throne in order to get everything

00:03:29.970 --> 00:03:31.120
So,

00:03:32.470 --> 00:03:36.660
Do you really think that I will leave Hae Soo because of the scar on my body?

00:03:38.980 --> 00:03:40.060
I...

00:03:44.960 --> 00:03:49.100
became an emperor with such a face

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:33.360
Episode 18

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:34.350
I asked to see you because I have news

00:04:34.350 --> 00:04:36.130
Yu Clan asks for independence

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:39.400
Ministers again ask for control of the army and taxes

00:04:39.400 --> 00:04:41.440
Since the capital change was stopped,

00:04:41.440 --> 00:04:44.240
Sogyong's powerful clans protest

00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:49.070
Yu of Jeonju and Hwangbo of Hwangju call upon you

00:04:49.070 --> 00:04:51.540
This fight won't go away anytime soon.

00:04:51.540 --> 00:04:54.290
I think you want to say something else

00:04:54.840 --> 00:04:57.020
Don't hesitate, speak up

00:04:59.010 --> 00:05:02.240
Then... let's get down to business.

00:05:03.720 --> 00:05:05.860
You should marry Princess Yeon Hwa

00:05:06.870 --> 00:05:11.940
If you marry her, you can solve all your problems

00:05:13.110 --> 00:05:16.240
This is our general opinion

00:05:17.940 --> 00:05:21.580
I will decide who I want to marry.

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:23.800
Really...

00:05:24.520 --> 00:05:28.110
You're not marrying that girl from Damiwon like they said, are you?

00:05:28.110 --> 00:05:31.910
You shouldn't get too attached to the throne

00:05:31.910 --> 00:05:34.090
Watch your words!

00:05:35.530 --> 00:05:38.240
Whether it is the Yu clan of Jeongju or any other clan,

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:41.050
they will try to tear this country apart

00:05:41.050 --> 00:05:45.040
Will you allow Goryeo to fall apart during your reign, Your Majesty?

00:05:45.930 --> 00:05:47.950
You worry too much

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:50.970
Your father worked hard to build this country.

00:05:50.970 --> 00:05:53.420
He sacrificed a lot

00:05:53.870 --> 00:05:55.860
And he did a lot to protect her

00:05:55.860 --> 00:05:57.650
That's the only reason I worry

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:01.350
That's why I abandoned my son

00:06:02.700 --> 00:06:05.160
and offered you her daughter

00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:18.620
It was written by Hae Soo

00:06:25.390 --> 00:06:27.930
She writes words that no one knows

00:06:27.930 --> 00:06:31.680
Judging by what she did in Damiwon, she is not an ordinary girl

00:06:31.680 --> 00:06:34.820
Moreover, she is rootless

00:06:35.300 --> 00:06:37.720
She has many shortcomings

00:06:49.950 --> 00:06:51.740
But I don't care about such things

00:06:54.780 --> 00:06:57.090
What's so great about this throne?

00:06:57.090 --> 00:07:00.880
You know you have to die to leave it

00:07:06.710 --> 00:07:07.930
Chae Ryong!

00:07:09.810 --> 00:07:11.260
Have you come?

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:13.480
Are you in trouble?

00:07:15.020 --> 00:07:17.770
I have good news, smile

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:20.890
Good news?

00:07:21.530 --> 00:07:24.800
His Majesty agreed to leave you in the palace

00:07:24.800 --> 00:07:26.460
Really?

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:32.140
But...

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:36.490
Will Princess Yeon Hwa become Empress?

00:07:37.110 --> 00:07:40.580
Why will she become empress instead of you, lady?

00:07:40.580 --> 00:07:44.390
Princess Yeon Hwa ordered us to prepare for the imperial marriage

00:07:46.660 --> 00:07:49.280
This is all a misunderstanding, right?

00:07:53.730 --> 00:07:54.840
Concubine He

00:08:00.630 --> 00:08:03.050
This place was full of life

00:08:05.010 --> 00:08:07.710
The 10th Prince loved this flying wing

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:10.380
Wow! Look at this!

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:13.330
What is this? Wow!

00:08:13.330 --> 00:08:17.670
The 3rd and 8th princes liked to read books there

00:08:22.910 --> 00:08:24.700
And this picture of stars?

00:08:25.280 --> 00:08:27.950
The 14th Prince really liked her

00:08:27.950 --> 00:08:30.050
Do you see? This is my star

00:08:30.050 --> 00:08:31.910
Oh, where's mine?

00:08:31.910 --> 00:08:33.490
You can't see, it's too dark

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:34.940
Yes, thank you

00:08:34.940 --> 00:08:38.520
The 9th Prince always asked me about alchemy

00:08:38.520 --> 00:08:41.510
Baek Ah was always busy drawing

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:51.210
Everything passed in the blink of an eye

00:08:52.570 --> 00:08:56.120
I know that you care very much about princes

00:08:56.120 --> 00:08:58.630
Yes, very much

00:09:01.840 --> 00:09:04.450
So I want to say this

00:09:06.830 --> 00:09:09.150
Please refuse to marry the emperor

00:09:10.430 --> 00:09:12.390
He will be stubborn until the end

00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:15.680
You have to let him go first

00:09:19.720 --> 00:09:21.100
I don't want to

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:27.670
I've been through a lot, I've waited a long time

00:09:28.900 --> 00:09:31.530
I did it believing that one day I would be happy

00:09:32.990 --> 00:09:37.430
If I was going to give up, I would have done it a long time ago

00:09:41.800 --> 00:09:44.650
If the emperor insists on his own, why shouldn’t I agree?

00:09:46.280 --> 00:09:47.790
I won't give up

00:09:49.310 --> 00:09:54.320
What happened to everyone who was here?

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:07.230
The palace where the emperor is located smells of blood

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:10.790
You don't know where or when something will happen to him.

00:10:11.360 --> 00:10:13.900
If someone dies because of your stubbornness,

00:10:14.700 --> 00:10:17.040
Can you relieve yourself of the blame for what happened?

00:10:19.190 --> 00:10:21.680
I've seen many people fall

00:10:22.440 --> 00:10:25.290
To prevent another tragedy, the throne must become stronger

00:10:26.360 --> 00:10:30.280
You may be a source of comfort to His Majesty, but you cannot be a source of his strength.

00:10:33.790 --> 00:10:35.630
You are not fit for the emperor

00:11:09.220 --> 00:11:11.670
Who said you can come here without permission?

00:11:12.310 --> 00:11:16.330
It’s just that everyone already knows how supportive you are to me

00:11:17.270 --> 00:11:20.430
Because of you, people will say that I'm only scary on the outside.

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:24.830
Don't want to go outside
and have fun with me?

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:26.300
Have you forgotten?

00:11:27.940 --> 00:11:29.550
Today is an exorcism ritual

00:11:31.030 --> 00:11:32.610
It's not the last day of December

00:11:32.610 --> 00:11:35.210
You shouldn't wander down the street just because it's a ritual today.

00:11:35.210 --> 00:11:37.630
Not around the palace, let's go to the market

00:11:37.630 --> 00:11:39.420
Let's go to the market

00:11:39.420 --> 00:11:40.980
Do you want to leave the palace?

00:11:42.540 --> 00:11:44.470
Leaving so suddenly...

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:48.530
We must warn the guards and court ladies

00:11:50.830 --> 00:11:52.540
Nobody will recognize us

00:11:53.710 --> 00:11:57.440
If you wear something else,
no one will know that you are the emperor

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:26.690
I only remember your smell and your laughter

00:12:26.690 --> 00:12:33.140
I'm always waiting only for you, counting the days

00:12:31.040 --> 00:12:32.380
Don't you remember?

00:12:33.140 --> 00:12:38.340
And it doesn’t matter where I am now, because only you are in my thoughts

00:12:38.940 --> 00:12:44.540
What I dreamed about and what I wanted

00:12:44.540 --> 00:12:49.140
Do you know what? Don't you know yet

00:12:50.230 --> 00:12:54.240
I just want to meet you

00:12:54.240 --> 00:13:00.040
Yes, I want to admit that I'm waiting for you

00:13:00.470 --> 00:13:06.340
And every day I can shout “I love you,” so what?

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:11.950
And every day I can call you

00:13:12.140 --> 00:13:17.740
Every time I will stand in that place

00:13:17.740 --> 00:13:23.240
Remember, remember, remember

00:13:23.240 --> 00:13:28.970
And day after day the thought of you does not let me sleep

00:13:28.970 --> 00:13:34.240
And day after day I think about you

00:13:34.240 --> 00:13:40.480
My heart is trembling so much, will you hear it?

00:13:40.480 --> 00:13:45.940
I love, I love, I love

00:13:46.140 --> 00:13:52.680
I love, I love, I love

00:13:54.880 --> 00:13:56.790
Oh this...

00:13:58.100 --> 00:14:01.920
Not as good as the original, but looks nice

00:14:01.920 --> 00:14:03.490
Really beautiful

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:06.600
Sounds like a place where wishes come true, right?

00:14:08.260 --> 00:14:11.180
Did you hand fold them to get the offer?

00:14:11.180 --> 00:14:13.180
Yes, I did

00:14:13.180 --> 00:14:15.420
You said you would propose to me near the prayer towers

00:14:15.420 --> 00:14:17.470
I was thirsty so I dug a well

00:14:20.200 --> 00:14:23.770
You should have run away
when we first met

00:14:24.640 --> 00:14:27.360
I was running but you caught me

00:14:28.710 --> 00:14:31.050
I don't remember what first attracted me to you

00:14:31.710 --> 00:14:33.770
Now attracts a lot of things

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:38.650
I have to live with you

00:14:47.690 --> 00:14:48.910
Let's live together

00:14:50.850 --> 00:14:54.300
Marry me

00:15:09.880 --> 00:15:11.330
I can't

00:15:16.530 --> 00:15:17.610
I...

00:15:19.700 --> 00:15:22.060
I can't give you anything but reassurance

00:15:24.280 --> 00:15:25.890
It will be hard for me to marry you

00:15:26.540 --> 00:15:28.670
Who told you that?

00:15:32.830 --> 00:15:35.080
I won't give up on you because of a scar

00:15:36.190 --> 00:15:39.760
And no one will force me

00:15:41.140 --> 00:15:42.950
I won't give up either

00:15:43.680 --> 00:15:45.850
I will continue to stay with you

00:15:47.490 --> 00:15:53.220
If I become empress or your wife, I will be bound by the rules of the palace

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:57.710
I won't be able to see you whenever I want, I'll have to follow etiquette

00:16:00.360 --> 00:16:04.510
This doesn't suit me

00:16:06.310 --> 00:16:07.460
You know

00:16:09.120 --> 00:16:17.270
Do you remember: I love, I love

00:16:15.900 --> 00:16:17.500
Everything will be fine

00:16:17.270 --> 00:16:23.540
I believe there was love, I’ll call it fate

00:16:19.970 --> 00:16:23.100
I...really...

00:16:23.740 --> 00:16:31.620
Do you remember: I love, I love

00:16:24.220 --> 00:16:25.310
ok

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:38.340
In your eyes, I settled in your gaze

00:16:38.340 --> 00:16:44.720
And I can only answer you:

00:16:38.730 --> 00:16:42.720
Even if you're not my wife, it's all the same

00:16:45.340 --> 00:16:46.810
you can't leave me

00:16:45.520 --> 00:16:52.020
Hold me if I'm swinging

00:16:47.770 --> 00:16:49.250
I won't let you go

00:16:52.020 --> 00:16:55.240
my love

00:16:52.210 --> 00:16:54.050
You should be mine

00:16:56.510 --> 00:16:57.900
You can't go anywhere

00:16:59.190 --> 00:17:02.720
my love

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:02.090
I won't allow it

00:17:07.280 --> 00:17:15.430
Do you remember: I love, I love

00:17:14.140 --> 00:17:19.630
You are my only empress

00:17:15.430 --> 00:17:21.700
I believe there was love, I’ll call it fate

00:17:21.770 --> 00:17:28.580
And I can only answer you

00:17:28.580 --> 00:17:32.240
my love

00:18:03.490 --> 00:18:07.390
Yong Hwa of the Hwang Bo clan becomes the new empress

00:18:07.390 --> 00:18:09.750
Get along well with ministers

00:18:09.750 --> 00:18:12.550
Let's celebrate this marriage

00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:16.080
I hide my tears deep inside

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:18.250
Congratulations on being named empress

00:18:16.930 --> 00:18:22.730
I want to forget everything about you

00:18:19.130 --> 00:18:22.180
Long live the Empress. May you be blessed!

00:18:22.530 --> 00:18:25.840
Long live the Empress. May you be blessed!

00:18:23.480 --> 00:18:30.030
It's time for us to leave the fate that brought us together

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:30.010
Long live the Empress. May you be blessed!

00:18:30.030 --> 00:18:38.380
Even in tears we will live with you

00:18:38.500 --> 00:18:44.500
As if a free wind will carry you away

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:51.980
I kept looking for the way to you, but I never found it

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:59.880
I couldn’t catch the fate that was moving away from me

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:05.120
So I'll let you go completely

00:19:00.400 --> 00:19:05.910
You are my only empress

00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:07.400
Love

00:19:08.090 --> 00:19:11.020
mine

00:19:30.550 --> 00:19:33.030
I wasn't even invited

00:19:34.680 --> 00:19:37.030
Although my sister said that I should definitely come

00:19:44.890 --> 00:19:47.690
Will you stay here even after this?

00:19:48.270 --> 00:19:49.930
Don't worry about me

00:19:51.860 --> 00:19:53.490
I'm not unhappy

00:19:56.550 --> 00:20:00.890
The late Emperor Taejo told me not to look into the future

00:20:00.890 --> 00:20:02.960
Asked me to live in the moment

00:20:03.870 --> 00:20:05.190
That's what I do

00:20:07.870 --> 00:20:09.810
Why didn't you just come to me?

00:20:09.810 --> 00:20:11.620
I would be kind to you

00:20:11.620 --> 00:20:14.020
I'm very tired of this place

00:20:18.450 --> 00:20:22.380
Let's fly somewhere like birds

00:20:25.430 --> 00:20:29.880
Yes, let's become butterflies and live freely

00:20:29.880 --> 00:20:34.480
I know that you will take me to the battlefields
and make them watch you fight

00:20:34.480 --> 00:20:36.030
Say you want it

00:20:36.620 --> 00:20:37.880
And I'll take you away from here

00:20:38.690 --> 00:20:42.170
Will you do anything if I say, “I want this”?

00:20:42.170 --> 00:20:44.110
Yes. "I want it"

00:20:44.540 --> 00:20:46.240
Just say "I want it"

00:20:47.580 --> 00:20:48.730
Remember

00:20:49.550 --> 00:20:51.100
"I want it"

00:22:06.730 --> 00:22:10.900
In the future, Hae Soo may be used against you in any situation.

00:22:11.920 --> 00:22:14.780
- It's better to get rid of the risk...
- You

00:22:16.120 --> 00:22:18.140
Perform the duties of the empress

00:22:19.470 --> 00:22:22.940
Don't cross the line again

00:23:01.430 --> 00:23:02.550
Madam?

00:23:06.670 --> 00:23:08.200
Are you okay?

00:23:15.410 --> 00:23:19.960
When the heart hurts, other ailments begin to appear

00:23:24.820 --> 00:23:25.960
Thank you

00:23:28.820 --> 00:23:33.650
I remember how Lady He stacked these stones near the 8th Prince's residence

00:23:34.450 --> 00:23:35.500
Yes

00:23:36.890 --> 00:23:39.190
She built a lot

00:23:43.980 --> 00:23:45.210
I miss her

00:23:55.370 --> 00:23:56.860
What are you praying for?

00:23:57.380 --> 00:23:59.200
No way

00:24:02.130 --> 00:24:04.320
I thought about my dead mother

00:24:06.560 --> 00:24:08.630
I'm fine

00:24:08.990 --> 00:24:10.640
My younger brothers and sisters are doing well

00:24:13.210 --> 00:24:16.140
You were sick. Are you feeling better now?

00:24:17.250 --> 00:24:19.020
I wanted you to feel better

00:24:20.020 --> 00:24:24.790
Still, it’s good that the disease did not worsen

00:24:25.630 --> 00:24:27.120
I always think so

00:24:43.710 --> 00:24:46.170
I'm doing well

00:24:49.140 --> 00:24:52.140
Will you hear him?

00:24:49.450 --> 00:24:53.750
I'm... doing well

00:24:52.390 --> 00:24:57.690
The same voice that is in such a hurry to confess

00:24:59.140 --> 00:25:01.590
Are you still listening?

00:25:00.720 --> 00:25:02.070
Very good

00:25:01.590 --> 00:25:05.740
Can you hear my heart?

00:25:07.590 --> 00:25:11.860
How raindrops settled on the window

00:25:12.540 --> 00:25:18.310
Also my mind is consumed by you

00:25:19.060 --> 00:25:20.510
Need you

00:25:21.610 --> 00:25:23.190
Need you

00:25:24.190 --> 00:25:26.460
I miss you

00:25:29.620 --> 00:25:32.620
Will you hear him?

00:25:32.870 --> 00:25:38.170
The same voice that is in such a hurry to confess

00:25:39.620 --> 00:25:42.070
Are you still listening?

00:25:42.070 --> 00:25:46.220
Can you hear my heart?

00:25:48.070 --> 00:25:52.340
How raindrops settled on the window

00:25:53.020 --> 00:25:58.790
Also my mind is consumed by you

00:25:59.540 --> 00:26:00.990
Need you

00:26:02.090 --> 00:26:03.670
Need you

00:26:04.670 --> 00:26:08.530
I miss you

00:26:24.040 --> 00:26:27.730
Now that you're all here I feel content

00:26:28.020 --> 00:26:32.090
So, in connection with my accession to the throne,

00:26:32.090 --> 00:26:33.500
I will establish the motto of my reign

00:26:35.160 --> 00:26:38.140
His Majesty wishes to establish the motto "Quandok"

00:26:38.140 --> 00:26:40.170
Good name, isn't it?

00:26:42.570 --> 00:26:44.640
We will do as you wish, Your Majesty

00:26:48.140 --> 00:26:50.430
Moreover, as you ordered,

00:26:50.430 --> 00:26:53.990
we are trying to distribute rice among those who were forcibly sent to the construction site

00:26:54.860 --> 00:26:59.520
And, regarding treasury management...

00:26:59.520 --> 00:27:01.450
please entrust this to us

00:27:05.140 --> 00:27:06.470
That's what we'll do

00:27:14.760 --> 00:27:17.150
With you, ministers who are trustworthy,

00:27:17.150 --> 00:27:19.200
I can go hunting and enjoy it

00:27:19.200 --> 00:27:20.950
I think reading will enrich my knowledge

00:27:21.590 --> 00:27:25.540
The court astronomer wanted me to read "Fundamentals of Politics in the Zhenguan Era"

00:27:25.540 --> 00:27:28.670
There is no better book that teaches the principles of virtue

00:27:30.560 --> 00:27:34.550
In addition, the 14th Prince Wang Jong

00:27:34.940 --> 00:27:38.400
guilty of treason, he will be exiled to his hometown as punishment

00:27:38.400 --> 00:27:39.460
Your Majesty!

00:27:43.250 --> 00:27:46.870
There must be a clear reason for this punishment to be meaningful.

00:27:46.870 --> 00:27:50.830
He suspected me, questioning the wishes of the late emperor

00:27:50.830 --> 00:27:52.840
Deliberately opposed me

00:27:54.100 --> 00:27:56.490
Considering that he and I have the same mother,

00:27:56.490 --> 00:27:59.010
I will not execute him, but simply deprive him of his position

00:27:59.010 --> 00:28:01.390
I'll send him to his clan in Jeonju

00:28:02.610 --> 00:28:06.870
Now if he gets close to Songak,

00:28:07.870 --> 00:28:09.700
will be sentenced to death

00:28:21.340 --> 00:28:22.500
Exiled?

00:28:24.930 --> 00:28:28.420
My Jeong... was exiled?

00:28:37.160 --> 00:28:39.580
Empress Dowager! Call the doctor!

00:28:42.120 --> 00:28:43.330
Exiled?

00:28:45.810 --> 00:28:47.720
He will be sent to his hometown

00:28:47.720 --> 00:28:50.460
This is the harshest punishment after execution

00:28:52.290 --> 00:28:55.320
He will be stripped of his position as a general and all his titles.

00:28:56.760 --> 00:28:59.680
And they will prohibit you from returning to Songak

00:29:00.520 --> 00:29:02.850
He won't be able to go anywhere except his home in Jeonju.

00:29:04.030 --> 00:29:06.400
This man led an army of three hundred thousand people

00:29:06.400 --> 00:29:09.060
He felt trapped, so he climbed over the walls every day...

00:29:09.930 --> 00:29:11.610
Now he will be locked in the house?

00:29:12.810 --> 00:29:15.920
We must talk to the emperor. If something happens to John...

00:29:15.920 --> 00:29:17.480
You can't interfere

00:29:17.480 --> 00:29:19.640
You don't have a son

00:29:19.640 --> 00:29:22.680
You may get hurt if you interfere

00:29:22.680 --> 00:29:26.860
This is not a simple dispute between brothers

00:29:26.860 --> 00:29:28.280
Woo Hee is right

00:29:28.280 --> 00:29:29.900
You can only watch

00:29:29.900 --> 00:29:32.630
Talk to the Emperor when he's calmed down a bit

00:29:43.960 --> 00:29:45.740
How is the Empress Dowager's condition?

00:29:45.740 --> 00:29:49.180
The doctor said that
neither your majesty nor his majesty

00:29:49.180 --> 00:29:51.470
must not leave the Empress Dowager

00:30:03.480 --> 00:30:04.570
Jeong...

00:30:05.970 --> 00:30:07.650
Bring me Jeong

00:30:07.650 --> 00:30:09.490
I'll call the emperor

00:30:10.640 --> 00:30:11.820
Jeong...

00:30:13.300 --> 00:30:15.190
I have to see Jeong

00:30:16.290 --> 00:30:17.520
Jeong

00:30:24.350 --> 00:30:25.450
Your Majesty

00:30:29.500 --> 00:30:32.250
From now on, I will take care of the Empress Dowager myself.

00:30:32.400 --> 00:30:36.130
No one can enter these chambers without my permission

00:30:58.970 --> 00:31:00.740
You need to regain your strength soon,

00:31:02.940 --> 00:31:04.010
mother

00:31:19.100 --> 00:31:21.100
I need to see the Empress Dowager. Move away

00:31:24.200 --> 00:31:25.490
Move away, I said!

00:31:25.490 --> 00:31:29.630
I won’t take a step until I see my mother. Move away

00:31:32.290 --> 00:31:34.430
Please let Jeong in

00:31:36.620 --> 00:31:38.790
If anything happens to the Empress Dowager,

00:31:38.790 --> 00:31:40.400
it will haunt you for the rest of your life

00:31:43.600 --> 00:31:45.050
You sent for Jeong, didn't you?

00:31:45.940 --> 00:31:48.280
I stopped everyone from sending him messages

00:31:48.800 --> 00:31:51.050
You were the only one who could do it

00:31:52.510 --> 00:31:53.550
Yes

00:31:55.290 --> 00:31:56.800
I did it

00:31:58.200 --> 00:32:02.200
He is far from his mother and cannot see her, he must be with her on her deathbed

00:32:02.580 --> 00:32:05.830
For his return he should be executed

00:32:05.830 --> 00:32:07.290
Your Majesty!

00:32:07.290 --> 00:32:09.070
Forget about your deathbed

00:32:09.070 --> 00:32:11.540
You should be glad I didn't kill him

00:32:19.000 --> 00:32:20.690
If Jeong is allowed into the palace...

00:32:21.450 --> 00:32:24.170
I won't leave it like this, even if it's you

00:34:06.920 --> 00:34:10.340
It's been five days and you haven't drunk a sip of the water I gave you.

00:34:12.640 --> 00:34:14.620
Do you want to die like this?

00:34:32.120 --> 00:34:33.210
Jeong...

00:34:34.470 --> 00:34:35.570
Jeong

00:34:36.890 --> 00:34:38.110
Jeong...

00:34:43.520 --> 00:34:44.610
Look

00:34:46.400 --> 00:34:49.300
Which son is on your side now?

00:34:50.660 --> 00:34:52.710
Perfect and ideal Yo

00:34:54.410 --> 00:34:56.380
is now in the afterlife

00:34:57.140 --> 00:35:01.700
Jeong, a treat for your eyes,
can't be near you

00:35:03.910 --> 00:35:05.770
You only have me

00:35:06.850 --> 00:35:11.480
I became the emperor and I protect you

00:35:23.350 --> 00:35:25.870
You will remember today

00:35:28.150 --> 00:35:30.100
Mother, you abandoned me

00:35:31.960 --> 00:35:33.820
I'm just not leaving

00:35:36.530 --> 00:35:37.760
From now on

00:35:39.530 --> 00:35:41.510
you will only look at me

00:35:50.130 --> 00:35:52.680
I will build a temple in your honor

00:35:53.780 --> 00:35:56.870
I will build the largest and most luxurious temple of all that is in Goryeo,

00:35:56.870 --> 00:36:00.320
which is perfect for you, mother

00:36:01.510 --> 00:36:06.910
I will also write stories about our relationship and spread them everywhere

00:36:08.620 --> 00:36:11.020
I'll tell everyone how much you took care of me

00:36:12.250 --> 00:36:14.490
And how I loved you, mother

00:36:15.290 --> 00:36:18.110
We will become the mother and son who loved each other so much

00:36:18.730 --> 00:36:20.690
Everyone will know about it

00:36:21.650 --> 00:36:23.160
And I...

00:36:25.240 --> 00:36:29.590
I will become your only precious son

00:36:34.910 --> 00:36:36.020
This...

00:36:39.000 --> 00:36:41.110
my revenge

00:36:42.440 --> 00:36:44.340
for throwing me away

00:37:26.730 --> 00:37:40.090
The flower will fall to the ground, it withered

00:37:40.720 --> 00:37:53.990
He will be all alone, so sad

00:37:54.560 --> 00:38:07.930
The sky will lose its stars, it will instantly become sad

00:38:08.640 --> 00:38:22.380
And suddenly it starts crying like a little rain

00:38:22.380 --> 00:38:35.770
It feels like a flower blooms and then withers

00:38:36.300 --> 00:38:50.730
Tell me with the wind, please

00:39:01.580 --> 00:39:02.760
You can come back

00:39:03.710 --> 00:39:05.410
I'll take care of my mother

00:39:06.250 --> 00:39:09.280
Your punishment will be renewed

00:39:12.740 --> 00:39:26.360
Do you know my heart that it always waits like this?

00:39:26.700 --> 00:39:42.560
If so, come back

00:39:39.990 --> 00:39:42.000
Why are you also on Jeong's side?

00:39:42.000 --> 00:39:43.730
You should be on my side!

00:39:43.730 --> 00:39:45.580
It's not about anyone's side

00:39:45.580 --> 00:39:48.810
Because of your vanity
Jeong couldn't say goodbye to his mother

00:39:48.810 --> 00:39:50.770
He's not that pathetic son

00:39:50.770 --> 00:39:53.070
I was the one who was always rejected!

00:39:54.510 --> 00:39:55.600
Your Majesty

00:39:56.380 --> 00:39:58.100
Right before he died

00:39:58.700 --> 00:40:00.740
she finally touched my face

00:40:01.770 --> 00:40:06.440
For all my 25 years of life
she was never there for me

00:40:07.840 --> 00:40:10.260
Is it wrong that I wanted to say goodbye to her in private?

00:40:28.070 --> 00:40:29.240
You...

00:40:31.270 --> 00:40:33.110
I should have said that you understand me

00:40:57.000 --> 00:40:59.640
Who added mercury to the bathhouse at Damiwon?

00:41:01.140 --> 00:41:04.280
It was Uk, wasn't it?

00:41:06.650 --> 00:41:08.450
I don't know anything about this

00:41:09.320 --> 00:41:12.860
The girl who served in Wook's house, Chae Ryung,

00:41:13.550 --> 00:41:15.420
wasn't she originally a maid in your house?

00:41:16.280 --> 00:41:21.190
Didn't you and Wook get her settled in Damiwon?

00:41:22.990 --> 00:41:27.400
The attack on our elder brother and the rebellion of Wang Gu -

00:41:28.280 --> 00:41:29.970
It was Uka's idea, right?

00:41:32.840 --> 00:41:34.910
If it wasn't him...

00:41:36.780 --> 00:41:39.230
I have to assume it was you

00:41:39.230 --> 00:41:41.050
It wasn't me!

00:41:41.050 --> 00:41:43.850
You know I don't have the capacity for this

00:41:43.850 --> 00:41:45.630
If you keep hiding it,

00:41:45.630 --> 00:41:49.300
We will punish you for deceitfully selling silver to merchants that was less than the required weight!

00:41:50.000 --> 00:41:52.170
As punishment, you will be lowered into a boiling cauldron.

00:41:58.190 --> 00:42:01.820
I just carried out the instructions that were given to me

00:42:07.280 --> 00:42:10.870
It was all...Uk

00:42:11.970 --> 00:42:13.780
He planned everything with the late emperor

00:42:35.890 --> 00:42:40.970
Then... I'll ask one more question

00:43:06.140 --> 00:43:08.280
- Woo Hee
- Yes

00:43:09.080 --> 00:43:10.660
What's the atmosphere like here?

00:43:12.070 --> 00:43:14.240
Where is Chae Ryung?

00:43:29.600 --> 00:43:32.120
What's happening? Why are you all here?

00:43:32.120 --> 00:43:34.710
The Emperor ordered us all to watch

00:43:35.970 --> 00:43:37.540
Emperor?

00:43:37.540 --> 00:43:40.560
He said this will happen to everyone
who won't watch his behavior

00:43:51.350 --> 00:43:54.280
What's going on? Why would he do this?

00:43:54.280 --> 00:43:55.950
Why would he do such cruel things?

00:43:57.710 --> 00:43:59.890
Damiwon's court lady committed a serious crime

00:44:00.880 --> 00:44:02.630
She must be punished

00:44:03.270 --> 00:44:05.790
Court lady... Damivona?

00:44:11.120 --> 00:44:12.430
Who are you talking about?

00:44:16.610 --> 00:44:18.300
Who is this?!

00:44:20.730 --> 00:44:22.130
This is Chae Ryung

00:44:56.220 --> 00:44:57.610
Su!

00:44:58.560 --> 00:45:00.360
Su, Su!

00:45:03.430 --> 00:45:05.590
My name is Hae Soo

00:45:05.590 --> 00:45:10.950
Are you my personal maid, Chae Ryong? Yes?

00:45:13.230 --> 00:45:15.060
Yes, sure!

00:45:23.130 --> 00:45:24.360
What happened?

00:45:25.010 --> 00:45:27.480
Why didn't you tell me she was sick?!

00:45:27.480 --> 00:45:29.280
I beg your pardon, Your Majesty

00:45:32.990 --> 00:45:34.070
Come out

00:45:37.680 --> 00:45:38.930
Chae Ryung...

00:45:44.080 --> 00:45:45.310
Chae Ryung...

00:45:59.930 --> 00:46:01.330
You can't get up yet

00:46:03.170 --> 00:46:04.240
Su

00:46:04.240 --> 00:46:05.440
Go away!

00:46:08.050 --> 00:46:09.130
Su!

00:46:09.610 --> 00:46:10.670
How could you?

00:46:13.400 --> 00:46:14.770
How could they do this?

00:46:16.190 --> 00:46:18.570
Why did they do this to a person?!

00:46:21.320 --> 00:46:23.710
They beat her to death like a dog

00:46:28.390 --> 00:46:33.390
Chae Ryung... She's been spying on you all this time

00:46:35.140 --> 00:46:36.180
What?

00:46:36.180 --> 00:46:38.280
She told the 9th prince about us

00:46:38.280 --> 00:46:40.470
You can still do a lot for me while in the palace

00:46:41.500 --> 00:46:43.600
This information came
to the Empress Dowager

00:46:44.250 --> 00:46:45.770
This was written by Hae Soo

00:46:46.410 --> 00:46:48.630
She took your things from Damiwon

00:46:49.320 --> 00:46:52.200
They suspected that you were a spy from another country

00:46:54.960 --> 00:46:57.540
- Are these also words?
- Yes, words

00:46:58.380 --> 00:47:00.520
You must learn to read and write too

00:47:00.520 --> 00:47:03.500
How can I at my age?

00:47:03.500 --> 00:47:08.450
To some extent she interfered with our wedding

00:47:10.780 --> 00:47:14.790
And she also put mercury in Mu’s bath

00:47:16.030 --> 00:47:18.460
Only you and I were next to the emperor

00:47:18.460 --> 00:47:21.820
But... mercury?

00:47:21.820 --> 00:47:23.210
It's not me

00:47:23.900 --> 00:47:25.160
True

00:47:29.080 --> 00:47:31.190
Do you remember the first time you came to the palace?

00:47:33.510 --> 00:47:35.790
Through the cave that reached the Damiwon baths

00:47:37.400 --> 00:47:39.560
Chae Ryung told you about this place

00:47:39.560 --> 00:47:43.450
Madam, we must leave here quickly!

00:47:44.760 --> 00:47:46.290
Quicker!

00:47:48.500 --> 00:47:50.670
Chae Ryung learned about him from the 9th Prince

00:47:52.410 --> 00:47:54.280
That's why Eun couldn't escape

00:47:55.060 --> 00:47:59.960
The 9th Prince and Uk knew about this,
that's why the guards were waiting for them

00:48:05.190 --> 00:48:06.270
Su!

00:48:07.130 --> 00:48:09.530
How could I forget about this place?

00:48:09.530 --> 00:48:11.050
Chae Ryung told me about him

00:48:11.050 --> 00:48:13.060
I said I'm upset because I can't see you

00:48:14.660 --> 00:48:16.740
Prince Uk knew about this place...

00:48:19.880 --> 00:48:20.940
Therefore...

00:48:29.690 --> 00:48:33.540
She tried to stay by your side
to keep us away from each other

00:48:34.330 --> 00:48:36.240
She was waiting for a chance to hurt you

00:48:39.140 --> 00:48:42.960
I had no reason or need to forgive her

00:48:46.110 --> 00:48:47.200
This girl...

00:48:50.080 --> 00:48:51.430
This girl...

00:48:53.960 --> 00:48:56.910
Her only crime is
that she was born a slave

00:49:00.660 --> 00:49:02.720
She was my little sister

00:49:18.550 --> 00:49:19.610
Rest

00:49:21.100 --> 00:49:22.370
You need more rest

00:49:24.230 --> 00:49:25.260
Forget everything

00:50:19.520 --> 00:50:21.020
This is Uk

00:50:22.490 --> 00:50:24.980
He came up with everything

00:50:26.080 --> 00:50:28.370
It all started with him

00:50:30.120 --> 00:50:32.420
He dares to use the throne as bait

00:50:32.420 --> 00:50:35.480
Does he think he can manipulate me any way he wants?

00:50:35.480 --> 00:50:36.520
Your Majesty

00:50:37.690 --> 00:50:39.380
You should understand this a little better

00:50:41.500 --> 00:50:43.460
Who do I have?

00:50:43.990 --> 00:50:47.350
Just you and Hae Soo

00:50:51.310 --> 00:50:53.000
It's all because of Uka

00:50:54.630 --> 00:50:57.210
Now in Su's eyes I have become a monster

00:50:58.650 --> 00:51:01.100
I won't leave him unpunished

00:51:16.120 --> 00:51:17.720
Mrs. Hae Soo

00:51:22.000 --> 00:51:24.930
This is what I got here

00:51:24.930 --> 00:51:27.500
I can't read

00:51:28.140 --> 00:51:30.290
Only your name

00:51:34.450 --> 00:51:37.420
How many times have you lied to me?

00:51:51.540 --> 00:51:55.210
Madam, please look after my family

00:51:56.000 --> 00:51:59.390
I know it'll be over soon

00:52:00.330 --> 00:52:02.490
I wanted to confess everything to you

00:52:03.770 --> 00:52:06.060
I won't have a chance to do this again

00:52:08.980 --> 00:52:13.440
I'm just a man who just couldn't stop loving

00:52:13.900 --> 00:52:16.150
I'm just a stupid girl

00:52:18.160 --> 00:52:19.730
Please help

00:52:23.030 --> 00:52:24.630
- Give me at least a drop!
- Leave!

00:52:26.150 --> 00:52:30.320
Please, help! I'll do anything!

00:52:30.730 --> 00:52:32.860
Uncle, give me some money!

00:52:35.490 --> 00:52:37.610
I like your persistence, baby

00:52:38.580 --> 00:52:41.120
Thank you. Thank you!

00:53:10.310 --> 00:53:13.100
I'm sure you will understand my feelings

00:53:14.660 --> 00:53:16.930
Chae Ryung has no regrets

00:53:17.820 --> 00:53:19.500
I'm not mad at anyone

00:53:21.080 --> 00:53:24.700
Is there any point in what we are doing...

00:53:25.420 --> 00:53:27.500
Only we ourselves can answer

00:54:06.130 --> 00:54:07.190
Su!

00:54:09.710 --> 00:54:11.450
Are you not angry anymore?

00:54:51.580 --> 00:54:53.790
I told you not to want more

00:54:55.210 --> 00:54:58.080
You have been deceived by some mask

00:55:03.140 --> 00:55:04.220
Go away

00:55:04.850 --> 00:55:07.590
You told me to be content with the title of Empress

00:55:08.200 --> 00:55:10.330
In this case, the transaction must be executed properly

00:55:12.740 --> 00:55:16.970
We're trying to get
same thing in Goryeo, Your Majesty

00:55:18.560 --> 00:55:21.760
You want to protect the throne, but I...

00:55:23.170 --> 00:55:24.770
need an heir

00:55:26.540 --> 00:55:31.470
I want our son to become emperor

00:55:45.480 --> 00:55:49.620
What if I tell you to betray Uka and your family?

00:55:50.130 --> 00:55:51.450
Can you do it?

00:55:56.400 --> 00:55:59.040
Can you completely abandon your brother and family?

00:56:00.420 --> 00:56:02.790
If you only become my empress...

00:56:03.670 --> 00:56:10.380
I will make our child crown prince

00:56:13.190 --> 00:56:17.930
You will be the empress and mother of the emperor

00:56:53.410 --> 00:56:56.520
There was no one in the chambers,
so I came here to look for you

00:56:57.370 --> 00:56:59.390
What should I do now?

00:57:01.670 --> 00:57:03.220
The man I love

00:57:05.330 --> 00:57:07.350
killed my friend

00:57:07.350 --> 00:57:12.180
The Emperor knew for a long time that Chae Ryong was up to something.

00:57:12.180 --> 00:57:14.920
That's why he tried to do this
so that she leaves the palace and you

00:57:14.920 --> 00:57:16.670
But she's stuck with you

00:57:18.600 --> 00:57:22.470
If she hadn't tried
stay in the palace even longer,

00:57:23.390 --> 00:57:25.190
he wouldn't do that

00:57:25.190 --> 00:57:27.020
It doesn't matter how bad she did...

00:57:27.710 --> 00:57:30.340
Was it possible to punish her so cruelly?

00:57:35.710 --> 00:57:38.690
I don't know how to get rid of this pain

00:57:40.990 --> 00:57:42.490
Chae Ryung...

00:57:44.270 --> 00:57:46.420
I just loved, that's all

00:57:51.370 --> 00:57:52.580
Don't do that

00:57:53.420 --> 00:57:57.840
When you make that face
even I'm starting to worry

00:57:59.170 --> 00:58:00.700
How is it for my brother?

00:58:03.590 --> 00:58:05.250
He's so worried about you

00:58:05.940 --> 00:58:07.630
He is sincerely worried

00:58:19.730 --> 00:58:21.890
I have a favor to ask you

00:58:26.520 --> 00:58:28.240
Give it to Jeong

00:58:33.000 --> 00:58:37.260
And give him my words

00:58:41.570 --> 00:58:42.720
Which ones?

00:58:50.410 --> 00:58:51.810
"I want it"

00:58:58.790 --> 00:58:59.920
If I do this...

00:59:01.560 --> 00:59:03.380
won't it hurt you anymore?

00:59:05.160 --> 00:59:06.210
Yes

00:59:07.930 --> 00:59:09.090
"I want it"

00:59:15.670 --> 00:59:20.540
Hae Soo... crazy...

00:59:25.290 --> 00:59:26.750
wants it

00:59:26.580 --> 00:59:32.580
As if a free wind will carry you away

00:59:29.180 --> 00:59:35.580
Thanks for watching with us!
Release group MANIA

00:59:29.180 --> 00:59:35.580
http://doramamania.mybb.ru
